      "committer": {
        "name": "NeoTech",
        "email": "andreas@roughedge.se",
        "date": "2026-11-19T02:36:56Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(2d): step a grown outline down from a stock top over Top Z\n\nReview blocker B1 of PR #2659: reach_up added only the flat levels under\nTop Z. With the stock top over Top Z (stock_over, the predicate of\ncut_levels_under) the material stands up to the stock top, so the base\nring of the #2597 part (stock 28, Top Z 25, stepdown 5) took its first\npass 8 mm under the stock top.\n\nupper_levels now gives a fresh ring:\n- no stock over Top Z: the flat levels under Top Z (unchanged);\n- stock top less than one stepdown over Top Z: one stepdown at a time\n  down from the stock top (off the flat grid, so the ring does not share\n  the Top Z plane with the band-0 ring, whose lead crossed it in\n  contour_whole_step case 1);\n- stock top one stepdown or more over Top Z: Top Z and the flat levels.\n  A Crossing there blocks the post visibly (#2677).\n\nPins: new_outline_steps_down_from_a_stock_top_over_top_z,\nnew_outline_takes_top_z_when_the_stock_stands_a_stepdown_over_it, and\ncontour_whole_step case 1 with the stock top at and over Top Z.\n\nRefs #2597\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
